    Compute the <doubled> from <hive> * 2.
    Log <doubled> to the <console>.
}

Create the <moorings> with [1, 2, 3, 4].
for each <mooring> in <moorings> {
    when <mooring> > 2 {
        break.
    }
    Log <mooring> to the <console>.
}

Compute the <step> from 1.
while <step> <= 3 {
    Log <step> to the <console>.
    Compute the <step> from <step> + 1.
}

